# Aegis-X V3 Frontend — SE Hard Locks
# DB-Only Read: UI renders only API snapshot/read-only results; no computation of regime/risk/allocation/targets.
# Single Write Path: State changes only via Control API (command/mode/E-Stop/Retract); no direct DB write.
# Safety Priority: EmergencyStop > Retract > Mode > Strategy; always visible and immediately accessible.
